WEBVTT

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:16.990
One hundred years have passed
since the Battle of Galluah Plains,

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:20.240
where King Kyle defeated
the Dark Lord Angmund.

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:23.700
The Demons rise again,
threatening the world

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:26.950
and spreading fear and unrest to all.

00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:31.490
The Black Edge are invited to join
the knights of Orvelia, rising in status.

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:36.910
Meanwhile, Malduk, the sorcerer
who summoned the Dark Lord 100 years ago,

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:39.330
rises from his long slumber.

00:00:49.410 --> 00:00:53.580
Now, let's start this exciting banquet!

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:28.910
<i></i>Memories in

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:28.910
<i></i>the Eyes

00:02:35.740 --> 00:02:40.490
Cleo! Wait up, Cleo!

00:02:40.490 --> 00:02:43.240
So does that mean you're on my side, Frey?

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:43.720
Huh?

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:45.240
Huh?

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:48.580
I told you, this is a serious bet.

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:52.450
D-Don't you feel sorry
to leave me out of this, Frey?

00:02:52.450 --> 00:02:54.580
There, there. Calm down.

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:58.290
You're always like that!
"There, there," and, "calm down."

00:02:58.290 --> 00:02:59.360
There, there... Oh.

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:01.620
Cleo, stop being selfish.

00:03:01.620 --> 00:03:05.330
Frey doesn't want to be straight with you
because she doesn't want to hurt you.

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:09.040
Frey is such a goody two-shoes!

00:03:18.830 --> 00:03:21.330
Oh, it's just a kid.

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:36.700
There must be a town or something nearby.

00:03:36.700 --> 00:03:39.540
Let's get some water and food there.

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:45.700
Now that I think about it,
you know what our party is lacking?

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:46.910
What?

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:50.700
A guide type person,
and a person who knows the way.

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:52.830
Aren't those the exact same thing?

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:53.830
Huh?

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:56.620
Besides, that's our job--you and me.

00:03:56.620 --> 00:03:57.540
Huh?

00:03:57.540 --> 00:04:01.240
You're supposed to use the knowledge
you earned in the Tower of the Sage.

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:03.040
What about you, Roi?

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:07.910
I... I've never been to these parts,

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:10.870
but I've traveled around to
a lot of different places.

00:04:10.870 --> 00:04:13.160
Oh, is that so?

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:15.040
Cleo, you didn't know?

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:16.870
Nope. Not interested.

00:04:16.870 --> 00:04:19.120
In a way, you're really easy to get along with.

00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:20.290
I know right?

00:04:20.290 --> 00:04:22.870
That's the first time anyone has
said something like that to me,

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:24.370
but that's what I always thought!

00:04:24.370 --> 00:04:27.950
Yeah... There's a bit of a learning curve,
but after that, sure.

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:30.580
Did I just hear you put a massive
caveat on a compliment...?

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:32.120
There, there...

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:40.290
Hey, is this...

00:04:40.290 --> 00:04:43.240
You are...?

00:04:43.240 --> 00:04:48.290
Ah, is that so? You are all travelers!

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:49.620
Y-Yes.

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:51.740
My name is Hendel, the mayor of this village.

00:04:51.740 --> 00:04:54.870
This building used to be
the assembly hall for this region,

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:57.790
but now we are using it as a shelter.

00:04:57.790 --> 00:05:00.450
Shelter? What happened?

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:03.870
The town north of here was attacked by Demons.

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:06.200
Everyone escaped to this village.

00:05:07.290 --> 00:05:08.870
Ouch...

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:10.910
Are you all right?

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:12.740
Excuse me.

00:05:16.410 --> 00:05:19.040
Wow, the pain is gone!

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:20.950
Are you a priestess?

00:05:20.950 --> 00:05:22.040
Yes.

00:05:22.040 --> 00:05:26.330
How wonderful... How so very wonderful!

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:27.450
Let me help.

00:05:27.450 --> 00:05:30.080
Thank you.

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:35.950
We're all working together
to build new houses,

00:05:35.950 --> 00:05:38.660
but we're severely lacking in manpower.

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:40.790
We will help as well.

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:41.790
Huh?

00:05:41.790 --> 00:05:44.660
They seem to need our help.

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:53.990
Hello.

00:05:56.910 --> 00:05:59.080
All set.

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:01.410
Wow, thanks lady!

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:03.200
Do me next!

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:04.830
What kind of hair are you going to get?

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:06.990
I can't decide!

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:09.870
Excuse me for a moment.

00:06:11.490 --> 00:06:12.830
Hello there.

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:14.950
We met at the forest earlier.

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:28.700
That girl is Elise.
She doesn't talk at all or laugh.

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:32.370
I see. What about her parents?

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:36.870
I don't know the details.
They're not here, though.

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:38.240
Which must mean...

00:06:48.490 --> 00:06:49.790
Elise.

00:06:56.830 --> 00:07:02.290
I know... My magic doesn't
have an effect on the mind.

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:04.700
It can't reach your heart...

00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:08.660
But just for now...

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:13.290
We should get ready to move out.

00:07:13.290 --> 00:07:17.910
Yeah. We should say goodbye to the mayor.

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:21.700
Um... Can we sleep here tonight?

00:07:21.700 --> 00:07:22.210
Huh?

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:23.740
Why?

00:07:23.740 --> 00:07:26.540
We have to get to the holy sword
as soon as possible...

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:29.080
I know. But...

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:31.580
Do you have a reason?

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:36.240
I'm asking you to indulge
my selfish wish, just this one time.

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:37.990
Please!

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:42.160
Well, if you of all people insist so much...

00:07:42.160 --> 00:07:43.700
Sure.

00:07:43.700 --> 00:07:45.160
Thank you!

00:07:47.790 --> 00:07:52.040
What?! That would be wonderful!
You are all so very welcome to stay!

00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:54.120
Thank you, thank you!

00:07:54.120 --> 00:07:56.870
Well, off to help, then.

00:07:57.490 --> 00:08:00.080
Um, Mr. Mayor...

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:02.660
Is it all right if I played
with the children a little?

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:06.040
Hmm? Oh, yes, please do!

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:10.790
The adults here can't find the time
to pay attention to the kids...

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:19.330
Hey, everyone, let's make a wreath!

00:08:19.330 --> 00:08:21.240
A wreath?

00:08:26.950 --> 00:08:30.290
Like this, and like this...

00:08:30.290 --> 00:08:32.120
See, how's that?

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:33.910
Wow! So cute!

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:36.490
You can wear it or hang it on the door.

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:38.370
Teach us how!

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:40.660
Okay, everyone, find some flowers.

00:08:46.450 --> 00:08:49.990
Wow, Elise, those flowers are so pretty!

00:08:49.990 --> 00:08:55.490
But maybe it'll be a bit hard to make
a full wreath using those flowers only.

00:08:55.490 --> 00:08:58.040
How about we add it to
this wreath, as an accent?

00:09:05.490 --> 00:09:08.330
Let's all draw some pictures
and put them up all over.

00:09:08.330 --> 00:09:11.080
That should brighten up the place!

00:09:24.950 --> 00:09:26.700
Let me borrow that for a second.

00:09:26.700 --> 00:09:27.830
No!

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:29.160
Ouch.

00:09:30.950 --> 00:09:32.660
Are you all right?

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:38.740
Elise, that was hurtful.

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:48.950
All done.

00:09:50.700 --> 00:09:53.330
Did I overdo this...?

00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:56.450
Ah, well... Let's see, what to do next...?

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:06.950
What's wrong?

00:10:08.740 --> 00:10:09.950
Is this...

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:12.700
Is this what you were drawing earlier?

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:15.330
Is this your favorite flower, Elise?

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:19.700
Mom... Liked these...

00:10:19.700 --> 00:10:20.790
Mom?

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:25.450
What happened to your mom?

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:28.830
Demons...

00:10:30.410 --> 00:10:33.490
Demons... My mom...

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:55.080
I guess Frey was concerned about that girl.

00:10:55.080 --> 00:10:56.580
Seems so.

00:10:56.580 --> 00:10:59.160
Frey is always the caring one.

00:10:59.160 --> 00:11:03.620
I can tell. She does have a real kind quality.

00:11:03.620 --> 00:11:07.580
I hope that girl opens up to her,
at least a little...

00:11:07.580 --> 00:11:10.790
But if they get too close,
it'll get tough later.

00:11:14.410 --> 00:11:18.450
I'm sorry, can we help a little?

00:11:18.450 --> 00:11:21.240
Oh? What will you help us with?

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:23.040
This.

00:11:23.040 --> 00:11:25.330
We'd like to make snacks out of these flowers.

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:26.620
Huh?

00:11:45.240 --> 00:11:46.510
Such a great smell!

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:47.410
How did you do this?

00:11:47.410 --> 00:11:49.490
These flowers are edible?

00:11:49.490 --> 00:11:53.620
Yes. Elise helped me out,
she worked very hard.

00:11:53.620 --> 00:11:54.620
Wow!

00:11:59.540 --> 00:12:00.990
It's delicious!

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:03.830
Elise, can you make some again later?

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:10.040
Elise, you can do this right?
You've learned the recipe, right?

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:12.410
Yes!

00:12:24.370 --> 00:12:26.080
Here we go.

00:12:26.080 --> 00:12:29.370
I can't thank you all enough!

00:12:29.370 --> 00:12:33.740
We do tend to miss out on the small things.

00:12:33.740 --> 00:12:37.450
I didn't think we could see
Elise smile like that...

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:39.620
Oh, it's so wonderful!

00:12:39.620 --> 00:12:41.910
I'm very happy, too.

00:12:41.910 --> 00:12:46.740
Miss Frey, how would you
like to stay here with us?

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:49.490
Oh, that would be wonderful...

00:12:49.490 --> 00:12:50.990
Wait, what?!

00:12:50.990 --> 00:12:56.160
With someone like you with us, everyone's hearts
will mend so much more quickly.

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:59.870
Please think about it.

00:12:59.870 --> 00:13:01.450
What?!

00:13:09.410 --> 00:13:11.910
I'll go check on the children.

00:13:11.910 --> 00:13:13.160
Yeah.

00:13:20.540 --> 00:13:22.950
Hey, listen. This is big.

00:13:22.950 --> 00:13:25.580
Earlier, the mayor was trying to recruit Frey!

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:34.540
And that's what he said!

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:38.910
She won't leave us and stay here, right?

00:13:38.910 --> 00:13:39.990
Never.

00:13:39.990 --> 00:13:41.200
Nah.

00:13:41.200 --> 00:13:46.620
R-Right, of course.
There's no way Frey would abandon us.

00:13:46.620 --> 00:13:48.450
Why would you even worry about that?

00:13:48.450 --> 00:13:52.040
I mean, if Frey left now,
it would be chaos!

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:54.950
The only reason the four of us
aren't falling apart

00:13:54.950 --> 00:13:59.580
is because Frey accepted
the role of go-between for all of us.

00:13:59.580 --> 00:14:01.910
Really? You're going to say that?

00:14:01.910 --> 00:14:04.950
You're the cause of most of the disturbances.

00:14:04.950 --> 00:14:09.120
Just today you called Frey
a "goody two-shoes."

00:14:09.120 --> 00:14:11.950
Th-That's...

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:15.240
Anyway! Frey is a precious companion.

00:14:15.240 --> 00:14:17.490
We all should be grateful to Frey!

00:14:25.910 --> 00:14:27.450
Please don't go.

00:14:29.240 --> 00:14:31.240
Please stay...

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:45.410
Ah, so you're departing.

00:14:45.410 --> 00:14:48.540
We will miss you. Oh, how we will miss you!

00:14:48.540 --> 00:14:50.490
Really, thank you very much.

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:53.160
Oh, wait, let me bake some bread,
take it with you.

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:55.120
Huh? But...

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:58.490
Don't worry about it! After all
the help you gave us, it's nothing.

00:14:58.490 --> 00:15:00.830
It's the least we could do.

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:02.120
Thank you!

00:15:02.120 --> 00:15:05.410
Yay. I'll go help.

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:10.580
I'll be right back.

00:15:10.580 --> 00:15:11.870
Sure.

00:15:16.990 --> 00:15:19.370
Elise, where are we going?

00:15:23.290 --> 00:15:25.200
Wait! What's wrong?!

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:36.790
Elise?

00:15:37.990 --> 00:15:39.410
Elise?

00:15:43.410 --> 00:15:45.870
Elise?! Open up!

00:15:45.870 --> 00:15:51.330
Elise, why? What's wrong?
Please, open this door!

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:55.370
Don't go. Please stay forever!

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:59.200
Elise! Let me out! Elise!

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:03.740
Where did Frey go off to?

00:16:03.740 --> 00:16:06.490
Did she really abandon us...?

00:16:08.080 --> 00:16:10.240
I did it again...

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:14.160
That was reckless. Here, I'll help.

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:16.450
I'll go find Frey.

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:18.080
Thanks.

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:25.330
Elise.

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:26.790
Where's Frey?

00:16:32.620 --> 00:16:34.410
Can you tell me?

00:16:40.120 --> 00:16:43.160
Hmm... I guess there's no other exit.

00:16:46.620 --> 00:16:49.910
I probably shouldn't break this down...

00:16:49.910 --> 00:16:53.040
Elise... I hope she comes back soon.

00:16:54.370 --> 00:16:57.660
Kasel! Oh, I'm so glad he's here.

00:17:16.620 --> 00:17:17.910
Hide!

00:17:51.200 --> 00:17:52.370
What can I do?!

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:06.950
Kasel, be careful! There's one more!
Please, notice! Kasel!

00:18:09.490 --> 00:18:12.080
I have to protect them!

00:18:31.830 --> 00:18:32.990
Frey!

00:18:50.540 --> 00:18:53.370
There's no way to know where
it will come from. Watch out!

00:18:53.370 --> 00:18:54.540
Yes!

00:19:01.120 --> 00:19:04.160
It's okay, Elise.

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:08.540
To hurt such a young girl's heart,
to get her involved...

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:32.950
I won't lose to these Demons! Ever!

00:20:00.120 --> 00:20:01.410
Are you okay?

00:20:03.740 --> 00:20:07.450
Thank you... Um...

00:20:07.450 --> 00:20:10.330
Sorry I locked you in.

00:20:10.330 --> 00:20:12.080
Don't worry about it.

00:20:30.240 --> 00:20:34.490
And you defeated Demons?!

00:20:34.490 --> 00:20:37.830
I truly, truly cannot thank you enough!

00:20:37.830 --> 00:20:42.540
Demons, huh? You should have told me--
I would have gone to help.

00:20:42.540 --> 00:20:45.910
I'm sorry, I got caught up just dealing with it.

00:20:45.910 --> 00:20:49.290
Thank you for such a generous gift of bread.

00:20:49.290 --> 00:20:52.370
Don't mention it. We should be thanking you!

00:20:52.370 --> 00:20:55.160
We wish you safe travels.

00:20:55.160 --> 00:20:57.740
When I see you again...

00:20:57.740 --> 00:21:02.200
...I will learn more snacks.

00:21:02.200 --> 00:21:04.950
Yes, I look forward to it.

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:06.410
It's a promise.

00:21:12.490 --> 00:21:16.580
At the end of the day, I want Frey by my side.

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:20.910
Huh? I always am. Why are you
saying that all of a sudden?

00:21:20.910 --> 00:21:25.910
She was afraid that her selfishness
might drive you away.

00:21:26.990 --> 00:21:31.370
Hey! That's the three final
super delicious cookies!

00:21:31.370 --> 00:21:34.990
We did say, the loser of the bet
doesn't get a cookie.

00:21:34.990 --> 00:21:39.080
You said yourself that this is serious,
and then you lost.

00:21:39.080 --> 00:21:40.700
You have to admit defeat.

00:21:40.700 --> 00:21:43.910
So, as promised, the three of us
will each have one cookie.

00:21:49.290 --> 00:21:52.790
There, there. Sorry, Cleo.

00:23:31.370 --> 00:23:34.910
I will put an end to everything in this world!

00:23:34.910 --> 00:23:38.620
Let us dance to the realm beyond death!

00:23:46.580 --> 00:23:51.990
In a town that was attacked by Demons,
we encounter an unexpected enemy.

00:23:51.990 --> 00:23:56.830
What are the intentions of
the man still remaining in the town...?

00:23:56.830 --> 00:23:58.370
Can the wails of the survivor
reach his loved ones?

00:23:58.370 --> 00:24:00.870
<i></i>Scars of

00:23:58.370 --> 00:24:00.870
<i></i>the Dead

00:23:58.370 --> 00:24:00.830
Can the wails of the survivor
reach his loved ones?
